+; Full-speed receiver for device mode: edge detection and NRZI decoding in
+; one state machine (simplekvm firmware/kvm-hid, checked cycle by cycle in
+; test/pio_rx_sim.py). Unlike usb_edge_detector + usb_nrzi_decoder it never
+; waits for the CPU between packets: every packet enters through "start"
+; (idle J -> K), so the line level (which loop runs), the stuff counter (y)
+; and the ISR start fresh, and back-to-back packets (a TT sends interrupt INs
+; right after SOF) are all received.
